<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Seller countered your offer</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; background: #faf9f7; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); }
    .header { background: #3d2b1f; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #f5e6d3; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .header p { color: #c8a882; margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .body { padding: 40px; color: #3d2b1f; line-height: 1.7; }
    .body h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; }
    .compare-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px 20px; margin: 24px 0; background: #eef4ff; border: 2px solid #90a4d4; }
    .compare-row .col { text-align: center; }
    .compare-row .label { font-size: 12px; color: #5c6b8a; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .compare-row .value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; color: #2a3a63; margin-top: 4px; }
    .compare-row .your-offer .value { color: #7a5c45; text-decoration: line-through; }
    .cta { display: inline-block; margin: 24px 0; background: #3d2b1f; color: #f5e6d3 !important; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; }
    .footer { background: #f5e6d3; padding: 20px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #7a5c45; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>{{storeName}}</h1>
      <p>Countered your offer</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Hi {{firstName}},</h2>
      <p>{{storeName}} responded to your offer on <strong>{{productName}}</strong> with a counter-offer.</p>

      <div class="compare-row">
        <div class="col your-offer">
          <div class="label">Your offer</div>
          <div class="value">${{yourOffer}}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
          <div class="label">Their counter</div>
          <div class="value">${{counterPrice}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>This counter-offer expires {{expiresAt}} — review it and accept or decline from your account.</p>

      <a class="cta" href="{{offersUrl}}">Review counter-offer →</a>

      <p><strong>{{storeName}}</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} EziHubb. All rights reserved.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
